-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(0, 51, 204);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>// 第一步：打开轻量应用服务器并安装Moltbot镜像</span></span></em></strong></p></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>打开轻量服务器，点击「应用镜像」，选择「Moltbot」</span></p><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;box-shadow: rgba(0, 51, 204, 0.02) 2px 2px 4px 0px;border-radius: 5px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=ed48cb75&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FV3ll7FMyGyMg6BubVIJaOsmj3oasZEM5uWOBjH0DrTvIpvMUwialGpJhTV6zKnklG1yVjlFv6WeDY29icBmTfoqw%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg%23imgIndex%3D0\"></p></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(0, 51, 204);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>// 第二步：配置Moltbot</span></span></em></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>1. 前往百炼大模型控制台，找到密钥管理，单击创建API-Key</span></p><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;box-shadow: rgba(0, 51, 204, 0.02) 2px 2px 4px 0px;border-radius: 5px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=59c37b5a&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FV3ll7FMyGyMg6BubVIJaOsmj3oasZEM5wVcucnRicLQfJCicONSKwQJSembUEQNvps8fibIEjOZHrBJia3f6FyyiaRA%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg%23imgIndex%3D1\"></p></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>2. 前往轻量应用服务器控制台，找到安装好Moltbot的实例，进入 「应用详情」 </span><span>放行18789端口、配置百炼API Key、执行命令，生成访问Moltbot的Token。</span></p><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-shadow: rgba(0, 51, 204, 0.02) 2px 2px 4px 0px;border-radius: 5px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=b79c6a9b&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FV3ll7FMyGyMg6BubVIJaOsmj3oasZEM55ZnnLuNa9JIUuFWGsKUib3SkM6ZzkH4Ic68alFljPGRjZPgbqvdsvTg%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg%23imgIndex%3D2\"></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>a.端口放通：需要放通对应端口的防火墙，单击一键放通即可。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span><span>b.配置百炼API Key</span></span><span><span>，单击</span></span><span><span>一键配置</span></span><span><span>，输入百炼的API-Key。单击</span></span><span><span>执行命令</span></span><span><span>，写入API Key。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span><span>c.配置Moltbot</span></span><span><span>：单击</span></span><span><span>执行命令</span></span><span><span>，生成访问Moltbot的Token。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span><span>d.访问控制页面</span></span><span><span>：单击</span></span><span><span>打开网站页面</span></span><span><span>可进入</span><span><span>Moltbot</span></span><span>对话页面。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"\"><span>此外，阿里云无影云电脑也已上线内置Moltbot和各种应用软件的专属镜像，预装了包括VS Code、TMUX、钉钉、WPS等组件，并支持钉钉、QQ等软件唤醒Moltbot，只需一键导入镜像即可启动。 </span></span></p><div style=\"margin: 0px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: center;color: rgb(157, 157, 157);letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>/ END /</span></p></div></div><div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 0px;padding: 0px 25px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"margin: 0px 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(88, 88, 88);letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 1.5;font-size: 14px;text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>点击</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 204);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>阅读原文</span></span></strong><span>，立即部署！</span></p><div><div><p style=\"clear: both;min-height: 1em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"><img alt=\"图片\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;outline:0px;letter-spacing:0.578px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;line-height:0;width:100%;visibility:visible !important;background-color:transparent;\" width=\"578px\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5a4871a0&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_gif%2FOmCbZ5JK30GbpbpADRYqgC6MMvNfRPY8cGySPF2f9miavJibvCOiaUelcS2LX6uSMGEic1ztD9ECCvN2rcupEseySg%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%26tp%3Dwebp\"></p><div style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"><div style=\"margin: 10px auto;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;\"><div style=\"outline: 0px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><div style=\"outline: 0px;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: i